	  <section>
		  <header>Introduction</header>
		  <text>

			  <p>
				  Using $PNAME with SafeRTOS requires an instrumented version of the SafeRTOS kernel (i.e. with trace hooks) as well as the TraceRecorder kernel port for SafeRTOS.
				  These are provided on request by <A HREF="https://www.highintegritysystems.com/">Wittenstein high integrity systems</A>.
			  </p>

			  <p>
				  The $PNAME integration for SafeRTOS uses the latest version of the TraceRecorder library, documented in <A HREF="Recorder.html#Creating_and_Loading_Traces___Percepio_TraceRecorder___Using_TraceRecorder_v4.6_or_later">Using TraceRecorder v4.6 or later</A>.
			  </p>
			  
			  <p>
				  See <a href="Recorder.html#Creating_and_Loading_Traces___Percepio_TraceRecorder___Using_TraceRecorder_v4.6_or_later___TraceRecorder_API">TraceRecorder API</a> for pointers to the TraceRecorder code documentation.
			  </p>			  

	        </text>
